// Package agentpb holds the Go code of the agent control protocol in
// contracts/proto/fps/agent/v1/agent.proto. The messages in agent.pb.go come
// from protoc-gen-go, and the ControllerService client and server in
// agent_grpc.pb.go come from protoc-gen-go-grpc. Both files are generated by
// the command in gen, and a test fails when they differ from the contract.
package agentpb

//go:generate go run ./gen
